# An 8-step staircase one block wide (no diagonals possible), start at the foot, goal on top.
name pure_stair
origin 0 0 0
size 10 12 1
tool HAND
start 0 1 0
goal 8 9 0
flags swim=1 break=0 place=0 scaffold=0 sprint=1
fill 0 0 0 9 0 0 d
fill 1 1 0 1 1 0 d
fill 2 1 0 2 2 0 d
fill 3 1 0 3 3 0 d
fill 4 1 0 4 4 0 d
fill 5 1 0 5 5 0 d
fill 6 1 0 6 6 0 d
fill 7 1 0 7 7 0 d
fill 8 1 0 8 8 0 d
